{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22130","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 一 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不动者厚地，不息者高天。\n无穷者日月，长在者山川。\n松柏与龟鹤，其寿皆千年。\n嗟嗟羣物中，而人独不然。\n早出向朝市，暮已归下泉。\n形质及寿命，危脆若浮烟。\n尧舜与周孔，古来称圣贤。\n借问今何在，一去亦不还。\n我无不死药，万万随化迁。\n所未定知者，修短迟速间。\n幸及身健日，当歌一尊前。\n何必待人劝，持此自爲欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}